From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 05:44:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rewrite homepage hero, problem stat, founder bio, and add
 industry section

- Homepage hero: replace generic headline with the automation-layer
  positioning already used in the LinkedIn company page copy.
- Problem section: swap the unsourced $12.4M figure for the worked
  $624,000 example from the Medium article series, with the math
  shown as a footnote.
- Founder bio (about page + team card): clarify that the enterprise
  client list is from Akis's product/design career before Ergofect,
  not Ergofect engagements.
- Services page: add an industry-first section (freight/3PL,
  insurance MGAs, healthcare groups, professional services) ahead of
  the generic six-category service list, matching the vertical
  content already written.
- ROI calculator hero: add a one-line pricing anchor ("engagements
  typically start around $10,000 a month") ahead of the sliders to
  close the gap with the $120k build-cost default.
---
